@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Verify UID (mock fixture)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/aniimo/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "10000001",
  "server": "TW1"
}

### Invalid UID / server
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/aniimo/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "99999999",
  "server": "TW1"
}

### Create a verified MyCard top-up session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/aniimo/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "10000001",
  "server": "TW1",
  "productId": "pack.twd.01",
  "paymentMethod": "mycard"
}

### Read a session (replace the id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/aniimo/sessions/SESSION_ID
